<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cosipa Q1 net loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cosipa Q1 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private steelmaker Cosipa issued the following statement on its first quarter results.</p>
<p>			  Q1 1997</p>
<p>    Net loss	    28.4 million</p>
<p>    Net revs	   317.4 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>However, when adjusted for inflation, the company showed a net profit of 8.1 million reais in the period, the statement said.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
